he Oak Depot\">Oak Depot</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Lighthouse\" title=\"Lighthouse\">The Lighthouse</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mike%27s_Mines\" title=\"Mike&#39;s Mines\">Mike's Mines</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Fungi_Finds\" title=\"Fungi Finds\">Fungi Finds</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Illumine_Designs\" title=\"Illumine Designs\">Illumine Designs</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Radical_Shack\" title=\"Radical Shack\">Radical Shack</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Alan%27s_AutoLogistics\" title=\"Alan&#39;s AutoLogistics\">Alan's AutoLogistics</a>. It can be found scattered all over the shops and you can buy the Mannequins for $250 each.\n</p><p>The <b>Mannequin</b> when bought from the store changes into one of the 20 known variants.\n</p><p>The <b>Mannequin</b>, the rc sellner, and the <a href=\"/wiki/Baby_Ducky\" title=\"Baby Ducky\">baby duck</a> are the only items in Oaklands that has this type of physics applied to them! \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variants\">Variants</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"774efacdcc9db072c1a195ce6fc97783\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Owo_mannequin-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Owo_mannequin.png\" title=\"Owo mannequin.png (99 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b1/Owo_mannequin.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240402171301\" title=\"Owo mannequin.png (99 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Owo mannequin.png\" data-image-key=\"Owo_mannequin.png\"